     <!-- Modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="appointmentModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="appointmentModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
      <p>
       
      </p>
        <div class="modal-content" style="border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden;">
            <div class="modal-header" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #799577, #799577); color: white;">
                        <h5 class="modal-title" id="appointmentModalLabel" style="color:#fff;text-align: center;">Book an Appointment</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" style="padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa;">
                <form>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="name" class="form-label">Name</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="name" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="email" class="form-label">Email</label>
                        <input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="number" class="form-label">Phone Number</label>
                        <input type="number" class="form-control" id="Phone Number" required>
                    </div>
                      <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="number" class="form-label">Age</label>
                        <input type="number" class="form-control" id="age" required>
                    </div>
                     <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="Occupation" class="form-label">Occupation</label>
                        <input type="Occupation" class="form-control" id="Occupation" required>
                    </div>
                     <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="Refference" class="form-label">Refference</label>
                        <input type="Refference" class="form-control" id="Refference" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="Purpose in brief" class="form-label">Purpose in brief</label>
                        <input type="Purpose in brief" class="form-control" id="Purpose in brief" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
*
                        <label for="date" class="form-label">Appointment Date</label>
                        <input type="date" class="form-control" id="date" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="message" class="form-label">Message</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control" id="message" rows="3"></textarea>
                    </div>
                   
                 <p  style="color:#000;font-size: 12px;text-align: justify; "> 
Firstly, I appreciate your move to seek therapy/ counselling for your mental and emotional wellbeing. Therapy is not a destination for us to reach, but it is a process where we explore, understand and work on various aspects which create distress. Therapy is a two way relationship, both you as my client and I will be responsible. As a client in therapy, you have certain rights that are important for you to know; and as a therapist, I have corresponding responsibilities to you.<br>

My responsibilities as a therapist-<br>
1. Whatever we talk and you share with me, all that information will be kept confidential.<br>
2. If there are signs of self harm or harm to others, then with your permission and by letting you know, the confidentiality will be broken to a person with whom you feel safe and comfortable. <br>
3. I'll make sure that the 1 hour of the session feels safe and comforting to you to share, vent out, be vulnerable, and take the steps ahead to achieve healthy well-being. <br>

Your responsibilities as a client-<br>
1. Turning up for the session at the decided time slot and day/ date.<br>
2. Paying for every session in advance.<br>
3. If due to any reason you want to reschedule the appointment, you have to inform me 24 hours before the session.<br>
</p>
<p>
I have read this statement. I understand my rights and responsibilities as a client, and my therapist's <br>responsibilities to me. I agree to undertake therapy with Mr. Aniket Deshpande. I hereby declare that in case I take any drastic actions which may cause any harm to me / my life, Mr. Aniket Deshpande should not be held responsible. I understand that the details that I share here would be kept completely confidential.  
</p>
 <button type="submit" class="btn btn-lg w-100" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #799577, #799577); color: white; border-radius: 25px; border: none;">Submit</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
